  exists_isAnisotropicMultiplier_coneFrequencySymbol α M m hm i ht

/-- **`lem:calderon`**, equation `eq:cone_identity`.

For every `ξ ≠ 0`, putting `η = D_t ξ` gives
`m(ξ) = c_Ψ^{-3} ∑_{i=1}^3 α_i ∫_0^∞ m(ξ) Ψ(η_i) h(η_i)² ∏_{j≠i} Φ(η_j) dt/t`. -/
theorem lem_calderon_cone_identity
    (α : Anisotropy) (m : E3 → ℂ) {ξ : E3} (hξ : ξ ≠ 0) :
    m ξ = ((cPsi : ℂ) ^ 3)⁻¹ *
      ∑ i : Fin 3, (α.weight i : ℂ) *
        ∫ t in Ioi (0 : ℝ), coneFrequencySymbol α m i t ξ / (t : ℂ) :=
  multiplier_coneSymbol_fullScale α m hξ

